            <p><font color="#ff00ff"><b><span style="font-size: 18px;">4.1&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b><b style=""><span style="font-size: 18px;">Health Expenses&nbsp;</span></b>(Within Last month)&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p><font color="#0000ff">1) Fees to private medical practices, 2) Fees to Aurvadic practitioners, 3) Consultation fees to specialists, 4)Payments. to medical laboratories, 5) Pharmaceutical products, 6) Expenses related to birth controlling<span style="white-space: pre;">	</span>, 7) Payments for healthcare workers 8)&nbsp;Other( specify )</font></p><p><font color="#0000ff">Does even the least number of these items apply to this month?</font></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>
